    "desc": "Whether a Vietnamese head spa in Da Nang is hygienic · what a January 2026 dermatology review found on salon brushes, why every published outbreak of salon-caught scalp fungus runs through a barber's blade, the wash temperature that decides the towels, and the one tool worth carrying in your own bag.",
    "date": "2026-11-28",
