      "Sort all of it out while standing at the counter: pressure, steam, how much time you really have, whether you intend to film. For the houses on <a href=\"/prices/\">the price table</a>, a 25 to 30 minute wash runs 120K to 350K and the hour 380K to 650K. Those sentences change the hour. They do not change the price."
